The network of a card number (digits only) by its leading digits: Visa 4; Mastercard 51 to 55
and 2221 to 2720; American Express 34, 37; Discover 6011, 644 to 649, 65, 622126 to 622925;
UnionPay other 62; Diners Club 300 to 305, 36, 38, 39; JCB 3528 to 3589; Maestro 50, 56 to 69;
Mir 2200 to 2204; otherwise `UnknownBrand`.
